    rdfs:label "urn:silmaril:entity#instances.papers.11_base_commutative_diagram.chapters.26_circuit_imprint_tensor.sections.03_tensor_construction.concrete_anchor_2#yonedanaturality_fcc" .
silm:instances_papers_11_base_commutative_diagram_chapters_26_circuit_imprint_tensor_sections_03_tensor_construction_concrete_anchor_2#yonedanaturality_fcc silm:hasLongDescription "The YonedaNaturality_FCC is the FCC (face-centered cubic) nearest-neighbor naturality: corners differing in exactly one axis are connected by a \"flip\" natural transformation. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'YonedaNaturality_FCC', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
